- Booking Status.
- Actions.

Include search, date filtering, booking-status filters, payment-status filters, sorting, pagination, and create/edit/view/delete actions.

Use confirmation dialogs for destructive actions.

#### Create booking form

Include:

- Guest name.
- Phone number — required.
- Email — optional.
- Address — optional.
- Room selection.
- Check-in date and time.
- Check-out date and time or number of nights.
- Room rate.
- Total amount.
- Payment method.
- Payment status.
- Booking status.
